{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a fantastic universe, form a group of up to 5 dwarves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a class then set off on an adventure in mines and galleries. Your goal is to extract materials there. However one of you finds yourself infected, and becomes a creature whose goal is to prevent his former colleagues from leaving again... Survive by working as a team but also by using your environment, your equipment and your skills to escape and trick your worst nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the monster's point of view you must evolve, move on the walls and ceilings. Use your skills to set traps, locate them, hide or hit your targets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the hunter or the prey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Lobby </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Cosmetics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements to Unlock</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3112420?t=1756042316","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3112420?t=1756042316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112420/6dc2e35e45b894954b5be223e4a769bcb4a4b17b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756042316","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112420/6dc2e35e45b894954b5be223e4a769bcb4a4b17b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756042316","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a fantastic universe, form a group of up to 5 dwarves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a class then set off on an adventure in mines and galleries. Your goal is to extract materials there. However one of you finds yourself infected, and becomes a creature whose goal is to prevent his former colleagues from leaving again... Survive by working as a team but also by using your environment, your equipment and your skills to escape and trick your worst nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the monster's point of view you must evolve, move on the walls and ceilings. Use your skills to set traps, locate them, hide or hit your targets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the hunter or the prey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Lobby </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Cosmetics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements to Unlock</p></li></ul>","developers":["HanoriaStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112420/4a6077fc0b8d89ed5f2dac16677a788052454992/header.jpg?t=1756042316","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257055260,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257055260/movie480.mp4?t=1726417836","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257055260/movie_max.mp4?t=1726417836"},"name":"Trailer 01","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamst